msgid "Oho! So it's you⑬the joker who's been all full of himself lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "And who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"What, you don't know me? I'm the reigning champion here at Mach Bowl. The "
"name is Death Bowler."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Death Bowler?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"You heard me. I'm the best bowler Mach Bowl has ever seen⑬and ever will "
"see! Death Bowler, that's me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "And you... you've caught my eye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Play a few frames with me⑬with the title of Death Bowler on the line!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Hey! Don't you dare ignore me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Leave me alone."
