msgctxt "228"
msgid "I'll have you play against me if it's the last thing I do! Mark my words!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "I'll be waiting right here, got it? Come back and take me on... or else!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
